<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 17.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 17.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 17	     April 16</p>
<p>Fed acct			 8.851		 17.884</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  13.028		 34.001</p>
<p>Cash balance		  21.878		 51.885</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,264.110	     5,299.758</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $92 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
